WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:02.068
-Your daughter, 8-years-old.

00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:04.104 align:start size:94% position:6%
-8-years-old now.
-Halloween coming up.

00:00:04.104 --> 00:00:05.605 size:78% position:39%
-Halloween coming up.
-Does she have plans?

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:08.608 size:75% position:38%
-She has huge plans.

00:00:08.608 --> 00:00:12.612 align:start size:94% position:6%
She has picked
a very elaborate costume

00:00:12.612 --> 00:00:14.314
that we´re gonna -- we´re still
trying to put together

00:00:14.314 --> 00:00:16.983
that she told me -- she goes,
"I know you´re going on TV.

00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:18.985 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don´t say my costume!"
-Okay, great.

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:21.554
-Like, you guys
will blog about it or something.

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:22.756 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.756 --> 00:00:25.358
But the thing about --
Every year, her friend --

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:27.160 align:start size:94% position:6%
She has this friend
who goes to this

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:31.231 align:start size:94% position:6%
very progressive hippie school
in Los Feliz, where --

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:32.265 size:84% position:42%
It´s the kind of school

00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:33.900 align:start size:94% position:6%
where it´s like,
"We don´t have walls."

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:37.137 align:start size:94% position:6%
And like, "Instead of
an A or an F,

00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:40.073 align:start size:94% position:6%
we give a sticker
of a smiling pomegranate

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:43.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
or a worried opossum."
Like, "Wait. What?" you know.

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:47.380
But they do this really cool
Halloween carnival every year.

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:49.382 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they --
and the kids -- these --

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:51.618
you know, grade-school kids,
put together a haunted house.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:53.787 size:78% position:39%
And it´s so charming.

00:00:53.787 --> 00:00:54.954
You go in, and they have --

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:56.990 align:start size:94% position:6%
They make hallways
out of trash bags,

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:59.159
and you go down the hall
and something jumps, "Boo!"

00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:00.260 size:81% position:41%
and the kids -- "Aah!"

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:02.128 size:88% position:44%
It´s just -- and I´ve --

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:04.330 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´ve taken my daughter
since she was 3,

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.000 align:start size:94% position:6%
and she just jumps in my arms
and hides her head,

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.568
but I can hear her laughing.

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:10.336
She´s like -- thinks she --

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:13.773
It´s hilarious for her to be
scared by this silly thing.

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:17.977
But the last year we went,
I don´t know why this happened.

00:01:17.977 --> 00:01:20.380 align:start size:94% position:6%
The adults
at the school decided,

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:23.116 size:81% position:41%
"We are going to help
do the haunted house."

00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:25.418 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I go in with Alice, and
there´s a bunch of other kids,

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:27.120 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the first thing
that happens, we walked in,

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:29.355 align:start size:94% position:6%
and this woman
dressed like a witch

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:33.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
pops out and says,
"I´ve killed Harry Potter!"

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:34.994 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.994 --> 00:01:40.633
And all of the kids go, "What?!"
and just, like, start crying.

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:44.370
And then she has to start going,
"No, but what happened was,

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:48.007 align:start size:94% position:6%
he used an amulet to save --
You´ll see at the end."

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:51.845
Like, she has to then tell the
whole story of the haunted --

00:01:51.845 --> 00:01:53.780 size:75% position:38%
So instead of, like,
a fun haunted house

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:56.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
with werewolves and ghosts,
it was, we walked in,

00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:59.185 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then adults just pitched
bad movie sequels to us.

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:00.487 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.487 --> 00:02:04.357 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I guess, uh..."
[ Applause ]

00:02:04.357 --> 00:02:08.294 align:start size:94% position:6%
And what really, really
bummed me out was,

00:02:08.294 --> 00:02:09.796
the first year I took Alice

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:11.598 align:start size:94% position:6%
through the haunted house
at the school,

00:02:11.598 --> 00:02:14.701
I saw the scariest thing
I´ve ever seen by accident.

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:16.202
Because, you know, again,

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:18.571 align:start size:94% position:6%
you go down these halls
and stuff pops out.

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:21.474
So I turn the last corner,

00:02:21.474 --> 00:02:22.609 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, you know, that´s where
you go, then the exit,

00:02:22.609 --> 00:02:23.743 align:start size:94% position:6%
this long hallway.

00:02:23.743 --> 00:02:26.246 align:start size:94% position:6%
And when I turn the corner,
at the end of --

00:02:26.246 --> 00:02:28.381 align:start size:94% position:6%
at the end of the hallway,
as I turn,

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:32.118
a kindergartner had gotten lost.

00:02:32.118 --> 00:02:33.853 size:78% position:39%
And the kindergartner
was wearing, like,

00:02:33.853 --> 00:02:36.523
an adult monster mask,
and on it´s tilted on his head.

00:02:36.523 --> 00:02:38.791 size:84% position:42%
So it´s this giant head
and this little body,

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:40.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he´s standing
under a red light bulb.

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:43.196 size:84% position:42%
So I turned the corner,

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:45.398 align:start size:94% position:6%
and there´s just
this little like...thing,

00:02:45.398 --> 00:02:47.800 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
like, at the end of this hall.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:51.905 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I --
I [bleep] my pants off.

00:02:51.905 --> 00:02:54.908 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, that´s -- Like, boom!
It was so...

00:02:54.908 --> 00:02:56.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Applause ]

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:58.845 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´ve never gotten over that.
It was so terrifying.

00:02:58.845 --> 00:03:01.648 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I hope you have
a less terrifying Halloween.

00:03:01.648 --> 00:03:03.149
Always great to see you, buddy.

